<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telemig H1 net 200.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telemig H1 net 200.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian telecom Telemig, a unit of federal  telecom holding Telebras serving Minas Gerais state, released the  following preliminary January-June 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		Jan-June 1997	    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>Net	     200.5 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Net Revs	713.4 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Oper Net	306.9 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Net Worth     1.972 billion	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
